WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.503 line:88% align:center
Real programmes have structure.

2
00:00:02.553 --> 00:00:04.268 line:88% align:center
Work sits inside other work,

3
00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:06.789 line:88% align:center
and some things have to wait for others.

4
00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:07.734 line:88% align:center
Let's add both.

5
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.499 line:88% align:center
To put one activity under another, click its name

6
00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:15.519 line:88% align:center
and press Control and the right square bracket.

7
00:00:15.569 --> 00:00:17.510 line:88% align:center
The row above becomes a parent,

8
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.209 line:88% align:center
and its bar now spans the rows beneath it.

9
00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:22.579 line:88% align:center
A parent has a small arrow.

10
00:00:22.629 --> 00:00:26.334 line:88% align:center
Click it to fold its rows away, and again to bring them back.

11
00:00:26.384 --> 00:00:28.057 line:88% align:center
You can go four levels deep.

12
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.553 line:88% align:center
Now for what waits for what.

13
00:00:30.603 --> 00:00:34.031 line:88% align:center
Point at a bar, and a line shows what it is linked to.

14
00:00:34.081 --> 00:00:36.349 line:88% align:center
The lines stay hidden until you ask,

15
00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:38.474 line:88% align:center
so a busy roadmap stays readable.

16
00:00:39.233 --> 00:00:42.313 line:88% align:center
The Links eye above the table shows every line at once.

17
00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:43.850 line:88% align:center
To add a link,

18
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:48.195 line:88% align:center
drag from the dot at the end of a bar to the row that has to wait for it.

19
00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:51.897 line:88% align:center
If a bar is moved so that it starts too early,

20
00:00:51.947 --> 00:00:53.142 line:88% align:center
its line turns red.

21
00:00:53.192 --> 00:00:55.108 line:88% align:center
Nothing else is moved for you.

22
00:00:55.158 --> 00:00:57.925 line:88% align:center
It is a warning, and Undo puts things back.

23
00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.803 line:88% align:center
And when you would rather not start from an empty page,

24
00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.120 line:88% align:center
Templates gives you a simple, a typical,

25
00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.321 line:88% align:center
or a complex roadmap to make your own.

